<p>Your desolate wastes are now rapidly crumbling.</p><p>Any foe moving through them is likely to get cut, taking <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> cold damage and bleeding over 4 turns (stacking) while reducing its movement speed by 15%.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>